# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# dumps/*.bin and *.hex (this project's own extracted config/firmware backups) are
# deliberately NOT excluded here (whitelisted 2026-09-07, see AGENTS.md's Publishing
# Gate) — they aren't vendor-released binaries, just data this project extracted
# from the user's own owned hardware. See dumps/README.md.

# Local secrets/state
.blheli32proxy/
*.pcap
*keylog*.txt
# Raw capture-session working dirs (pcaps, server/request logs) -- never git-tracked,
# may contain real network/host details and other locally-identifying info (2026-11-11).
# A specific finding worth keeping gets copied into docs/knowledge/activation-licensing.md
# by hand instead -- never the raw capture itself.
docs/knowledge/captures-*/

# This project tracks its own AI-instruction files (referenced from README.md/PLAN.md),
# overriding the user's global ~/.gitignore exclusion of them.
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md

# AI skills ship with the repo so end-users get them too. Local Claude state does not.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
